{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"Falling Objects","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"7148fcb2b952cfc2d61af1389677e05ffb716a15368d1b38bd42aa5136da6534","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"The party retreats with Misha, and Skullshatterer, the Reunion leader, does not give chase.\nElsewhere, Exusiai leads everyone to the rooftop of a building. Her chosen route is...","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Hurry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss Misha! Please follow us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...How... can this be..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"This way, hurry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"This area is clear! Be careful, they're still after us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Are they also...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"They're also... Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are the Infected fighting each other..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"You... let them go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"They can't run."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"But I've finally found her-- No, no..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"She's finally... come to me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"We've arrived."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"...Are you serious?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"That's what the markings say."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"But... this route is heading up, isn't it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"How's that going to help us?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"Amiya, Amiya! Up here, that's right, come up here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"--Exusiai!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you certain...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"Trust me, I wouldn't mess up~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"I know Lungmen's roads like the back of my hand!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aha..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's head up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Wouldn't that be... waiting for the enemy to surround us?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"If you don't hurry and Reunion finds us, maybe!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch... Wait, you guys go first..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll go weld the gate's entrance so Reunion can't get in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There's a penguin logo on the staircase here. Is this the place?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure is. Head forward and take a left, then take the stairs up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That will take us inside the building..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Weren't we going to go underground?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"No, no, I just said we were heading upstairs."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"...Upstairs?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you sure... she's trustworthy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"'As long as we get to the destination, any route can be taken.' That's one of our mottos here at Penguin Logistics."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Just try our service once. You'll love it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"*gasp*... *gasp*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, Misha... I didn't know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, you."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you Dr. {@nickname} of Rhodes Island?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't seem to like climbing stairs."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Skullshatterer"]}]}
